sentences.text:
Based on a perusal of the record,
the following issues arise for consideration in the present appeal:
First, whether the insurer had locus standi to file the complaint as a subrogee?;
Second, whether the Appellant-hotel can be held liable for the theft of a car taken for valet parking, under the laws of bailment or otherwise?;
Third, if the second question is answered in the affirmative, what is the degree of care required to be taken by the Appellant- Hotel?; and Fourth, whether the Appellant-hotel can be absolved of liability by virtue of a contract?

